TrustTunnel VPN client (CLI).

C++/Rust client library + `trusttunnel_client` binary that connects to a
TrustTunnel endpoint. Upstream supports system-wide tunnels and SOCKS5 on
selected platforms, but v1.1.5-rc.6 has no FreeBSD TUN backend. This FreeBSD
package is experimental until a functional OPNsense E2E test passes.

Pair with `security/trusttunnel` for the server-side daemon.

WWW: https://github.com/TrustTunnel/TrustTunnelClient
